 *
 * `./local.sh args.trp -- 7 llj`. After `IfcUtil.declassifyDeep` on the argument list the values
 * are public and the blocking label is at the root level:
 *
 *   PC:{}  BL:{}
 *   PC:{}  BL:{}
 *   PC:{}  BL:{#ROOT}
 *   ["7"@{}%{}, "llj"@{}%{}]@{}%{}
 *   PC:{}  BL:{#ROOT}
 *   2@{}%{}
